{"id":"ilha","lemma":"ilha","pos":"noun","rank":785,"glosses":["island","a group of houses in a poor area of a town","a person who stands alone in defense of an idea"],"ipa":"/ˈi.ʎɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ilhas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-ilha.wav","examples":[{"text":"Podemos ver a ilha a distância.","en":"We can see the island in the distance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/63960","words":[{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / to"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"at a distance"]]},{"text":"Há hotéis na ilha?","en":"Are there hotels on the island?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1268228","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"hotel","l":"hotel"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Não havia árvores na ilha.","en":"There were no trees on the island.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"tree","l":"árvore"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"É impossível viver naquela ilha.","en":"It's impossible to live on that island.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"impossible"},{"g":"to live"},null,null]},{"text":"Não havia sinal de vida na ilha.","en":"There were no signs of life on the island.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"sign"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"state of being alive"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}